<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Hey {{ name }}!</p>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
        Your DMARCo one-time login code is:
    </p>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
        <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: bold;">{{ code }}</span>
    </p>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
        This code expires in a few minutes.
    </p>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
        If you did not attempt to sign in, please contact support.
    </p>

    <p style="margin: 0;">Thank you,<br>The DMARCo Team</p>
</div>
